# command: grep -oE "(Symbol|Function)\('mu_theta_[LM]_[a-z0-9]+'\)" comparator_run.out   -> (no output)
# command: grep -oE "Derivative\([^)]*mu_theta[^)]*" comparator_run.out                    -> (no output)
# => across all 37300 lines, WL NEVER differentiates mu_theta (0 in-plane/normal jets, 0 Derivative wrappers).
#    mu_theta appears ONLY as bare Symbol('mu_theta_{L,M}') (PY) or applied
#    Function('mu_theta_{L,M}')(x1,x2,x3,time) (WL) at the SAME 4 args. If WL treated mu_theta as an x-field
#    the shape derivative would emit a d_x(mu_theta) jet; none exists -> evaluation-point args are inert.
#    counts: mu_theta_L applied=1776 bare=1820 ; mu_theta_M applied=2686 bare=3378.
